It is Wednesday evening.
I am sitting comfortably on the sofa.
My laptop is lying closed on the table.
I do not need it right now.
I still have to complete a small task.
I have been meaning to do this for a long time.
It is about my account for the U-Bahn.
My email address on the website is still the old one.
It is my first address from Mexico.
I have to finally change it.
Normally I do this kind of thing in the evening on my phone.
Today is just the same.
I take my phone and open the portal.
I log in with my password.
Fortunately, that goes quickly.
Now I see my profile on the screen.
The old address is still there.
Mostly, a change here only takes a few minutes.
The site is open and I am ready.
